<v Susan Burton>American Girl Place knows what girls want. And these days, this includes a look-alike doll. The American Girls of Today are available in 20 different skin, hair, and eye color combinations. Almost every single girl I talked to with a Today doll says she picked the one she did because it looked like her. And the Today accessories are varied enough to allow any girl to pursue her particular obsession.
<v Susan Burton>美国女孩广场知道女孩想要什么。如今，这包括一个长得像自己的玩偶。今天的“美国女孩”有20种不同的肤色、发色和眼睛颜色组合。我聊过的几乎每一个拥有“当代女孩”玩偶的女孩都说，她选择这个是因为它看起来像她自己。而且“当代”配饰种类繁多，足以让任何女孩追求她特别的痴迷。

