<v Susan Burton>We head back up to the American Girl of Today room. Girls pulling out boxes, trying on slippers, crowding the aisles in a final shopping frenzy. This is the only thing in the store that's not a game of make believe believe. Buying.
<v Susan Burton>我们回到“今日美国女孩”房间。女孩们拿出盒子，试穿拖鞋，挤在过道里进行最后的购物狂欢。这是店里唯一不是假装游戏的东西。购买。

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.610
<v Laura Robertson>What's the decision?
<v Laura Robertson>决定是什么？

