<v Susan Burton>Whitney shows us her final pick. It's an outfit the girls wore in the musical's finale, white overalls emblazoned with a silver star. She also has a doll-sized American Girl Place t-shirt and a snow dome that trills a song from the musical.
<v Susan Burton>惠特尼展示了她最后的选择。那是女孩们在音乐剧结尾穿的衣服，绣着银星的白色背带裤。她还有一个玩偶大小的“美国女孩广场”T恤和一个摇晃后会演奏音乐剧中歌曲的雪景球。

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:40.720
<v Susan Burton>These accessories aren't about history, or anything other than the experience of coming to the store. The brand itself. One thing Whitney likes about the outfit she has bought for her doll, she tells me, is that it comes with a miniature red shopping bag stamped with the words American Girl Place. The cashier puts Whitney's items into a bright red sack of her own. And she and her mother head out to Michigan Avenue.
<v Susan Burton>这些配饰与历史无关，除了来到店里的体验之外什么都没有。品牌本身。惠特尼喜欢她为玩偶买的这套衣服的一点，她告诉我，是因为它带有一个印着“美国女孩广场”字样的迷你红色购物袋。收银员把惠特尼的商品装进她自己明亮的红色袋子里。她和她母亲向密歇根大道走去。

